# MODULE chunked normalized preflight with command byte offsets
# PURPOSE check all eight commands and bracket matching before any guest run
# INPUT repeated nonzero chunk counts and exact command bytes
# INPUT zero chunk count followed by nonzero hexadecimal A5 guard
# OUTPUT exactly three bytes status offset low and offset high
# PROFILE source positions are zero based sixteen bit command byte offsets
# PROFILE status zero OK one illegal byte two unmatched open three unmatched close
# PROFILE status ten bounded overflow eleven malformed completion guard
# PROFILE offsets are FFFF when no source offset is applicable
# PROFILE first illegal byte beats unmatched closing and opening errors
# PROFILE unmatched closing beats unmatched opening bracket
# PROFILE malformed guard and checked overflow override source status
# TAPE fixed register window holds state and one byte temporary values
# LIMITATION only normalized byte streams not annotated original source
# LIMITATION component accepts at most sixty five thousand five hundred thirty five commands
# LIMITATION nesting depth at most two hundred fifty five
# LIMITATION host must attest actual complete reads and stream closure
# SAFETY emits no guest code and exactly one terminal result after guard check

